SUMMARY:SoloRio at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Gather for Friday evening fun: dining\, dancing\, and community amongst the Russian River redwoods at Rio Nido Roadhouse with local favorites\, SoloRio! A rustic\, rootsy\, roadhouse vibe. Kid-friendly. Full bar & food. Let the good times roll! \nSoloRio is a fresh “Folkadelic GaragiCana” rock stone soup collaboration band based in the North Bay Area\, California. Each\ninspired by decades of varied influences and geographies\, the ‘Solo’ core is C. Cameron Anderson\, Andy Tester\, Andy ‘Dru’ Rodgers\,\nJay Young and Steven Cano.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/solorio-at-rio-nido-roadhouse/
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse\, 14540 Canyon 2 Road\, Rio Nido\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
