SUMMARY:Boys & Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin presents Healdsburg in Bloom
DESCRIPTION:Boys & Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin is hosting their annual dinner & auction Healdsburg in Bloom. Join us Friday\, April 24th\, at the historic Villa Chanticleer for an elegant evening that celebrates 22 years of community and nearly eight decades of service to Healdsburg youth. \nWe are proud to honor our roots while raising vital funds for after-school and summer programs supporting over 400 local children in Healdsburg—where great futures begin to bloom. Guests will enjoy an evening of connecting with others passionate about empowering youth and a world-class culinary experience catered by the renowned Troubadour Bread & Bistro\, paired with exquisite local wines and high-energy auctions. \nAll proceeds will benefit the Boys & Girls Clubs of Sonoma-Marin to support life-changing programs for local youth. \nLearn how to sponsor and get tickets at https://www.bgcsonoma-marin.org/healdsburginbloom
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/boys-girls-clubs-of-sonoma-marin-presents-healdsburg-in-bloom/
LOCATION:Villa Chanticleer\, 900 Chanticleer Way\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
GEO:38.6216;-122.849
