SUMMARY:AWS Apple Blossom Art Artist Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Art Workshop of Western Sonoma County (AWS) is celebrating more than 50 years of the Apple Blossom Art Show.\nArtists’ reception on Friday\, April 24\, from 7 to 9 pm\nSebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High Street\, Sebastopol CA.\nAdmission is free\, wine and appetizers will be served\, and live music will be performed by Copley & Radice.
