SUMMARY:Friday Night with dBRx and David Noble
DESCRIPTION:Rock band dBRx loves soulful and powerful music that hits you where it counts.\nThey play those not-so-guilty pleasures you should admit you love\, as well as unexpected deep cuts and hidden gems – with riffs that occupy your ears long after they’re over. On occasion\, a dBRx original sneaks its way in. \nOpening the night is a solo performance by David Noble of Pardon The Interruption and Wreckless Strangers. A masterful guitarist with a velvet voice- this musician will have you groovin’ and movin’ to his acoustic tunes! \nSnacks and craft mocktails available ✨ \nAll ages ⎸ $15 online or at the door
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/friday-night-with-dbrx-and-david-noble/
LOCATION:WonderStump!\, 301 Petaluma Blvd. N. Suite B\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
