SUMMARY:The Jody Counter Band at The Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:BAND BIO:\nThe Jody Counter Band is a popular Sonoma County group playing a mix of blues\, rock\, and R&B\, voted the best country band in the area in 2023. They frequently perform at local venues like The Penngrove Pub\, Spancky’s Bar\, and Golden Gate Bistro. \nKey details about the band include: \nGenre: A blend of blues\, rock & roll\, and R&B. \nAccolades: Voted Best Country Band in Sonoma County 2023. \nActive Venues: Regularly play at The Penngrove Pub\, Spancky’s Bar\, and Golden Gate Bistro. \nRegional Presence: Recognized as a premier live band in the North Bay and Sonoma County.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/jody-counter-band-at-the-penngrove-pub/
