SUMMARY:Velvet Fog at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Decades of hits\, high energy\, and near-album quality sound—The Velvet Fog brings the ultimate live cover experience.\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of live music as The Velvet Fog takes the stage on Friday\, April 24 for an evening packed with energy\, groove\, and crowd-favorite hits!\nBringing their signature blend of danceable classics\, smooth harmonies and feel-good vibes\, The Velvet Fog knows how to keep the party moving from the first note to the last encore. \nSpecial Guests: Coffey Park Kicking off the night\, Coffey Park will set the tone with their dynamic sound and infectious stage presence — the perfect way to start an epic Friday night out. \nGrab your friends\, hit the dance floor\, and make it a night to remember. Great music\, great company\, and great vibes await! \nFriday\, April 24 Don’t miss it! \nDoors Open: 6:30 PM | Show Starts: 7:30 PM\nTickets $15 in advance. $22 at door
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/velvet-fog-at-the-california-theatre/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Velvet-Fog.jpg
