SUMMARY:Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour
DESCRIPTION:Gary Owen has been entertaining audiences for more than two decades with his sharp observational humor and fearless storytelling. Known for his unapologetic\, rule-defying style\, his material draws from his personal life\, time in the military\, and the everyday absurdities that connect people across backgrounds. With a fanbase that has grown by the millions in recent months and continues to surge across social media\, Owen’s reach has cemented his place as one of the most in-demand touring comedians today.\nBeyond stand-up\, Owen has appeared in a wide range of feature films and television. He continues to write\, produce\, and perform his own groundbreaking comedy specials. In addition to his on-stage and on-screen work\, Owen hosts his own podcast\, #GetSome with Gary Owen.\nAges 12+ Recommended\nVIP 1: Gary Owen VIP Meet & Greet Package\nPremium Seat Ticket\nMeet & Greet with Gary Owen\nPhoto with Gary Owen\nCommemorative VIP Laminate\nExclusive Autographed Merchandise Item\nVIP 2: Gary Owen VIP Merchandise Package\nPremium Seat Ticket\nExclusive Autographed Merchandise Item\n*No artist participation
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/gary-owen-no-hard-feelings-tour/
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts\, 50 Mark West Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy
