SUMMARY:Petaluma Bounty's 16th Annual Spring Plant Sale-Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Set your spring/summer garden up for success with healthy vegetable\, herb\, and flower starts straight from our farm. All plants are grown using sustainable practices — no chemicals. We accept cash\, card\, and CalFresh/EBT. We offer a 50% discount for CalFresh/EBT customers up to $20. \nThis sale is open to all from 10 a.m. to 1 p.m. We will have a special shopping hour (9-10 a.m.) for immunocompromised customers\, people with disabilities\, and CalFresh customers paying with their EBT cards. 10-1 is open to all. We will post more information on our webiste\, including a plant list\, as the date approaches. \nProceeds support our nonprofit farm and programs. Petaluma Bounty is a food security project\, working to strengthen local foos systems and support community members who may have difficulty accessing fresh\, local food.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/petaluma-bountys-16th-annual-spring-plant-sale-fundraiser/
LOCATION:Petaluma Bounty Community Farm\, 55 Shasta Avenue\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
