SUMMARY:Culinary Rummage Sale- a fundraiser for Les Dames d'Escoffier
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma Chapter of Les Dames d’Escoffier hosts a Culinary Rummage Sale featuring the ultimate treasure trove of culinary finds curated from both amateur and professional kitchens. \nThis one-day event will offer a treasure trove of culinary finds curated from both amateur and professional kitchens. Shoppers can browse an eclectic mix of cookbooks\, cookware\, tabletop items\, wine and beverage glasses\, service ware\, and vintage culinary pieces\, making it a must-visit for home cooks\, collectors\, and food lovers alike. \nJimtown and Then Sum will be open and serving breakfast\, lunch\, coffee and other beverages. \nProceeds from the culinary rummage sale will directly support the Sonoma Chapter of Les Dames d’Escoffier International and its mission to inspire\, advance\, and support women leaders in the culinary\, fine beverage\, and hospitality industries. Funds raised help fuel the chapter’s work in education\, mentorship\, and philanthropy\, including grants and community-based initiatives.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/culinary-rummage-sale-a-fundraiser-for-les-dames-descoffier/
LOCATION:Jimtown and Then Sum- historic barn\, 6706 CA-128\, Healdsburg\, CA\, 95448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
