SUMMARY:Sonoma’s Inaugural Earth Day Event
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the City of Sonoma’s Inaugural Earth Day\, a new community event focused on sustainability\, climate action\, and local solutions. \nPresented in partnership with the Sonoma Community Center\, Earth Day programming will take place concurrently with Trash Bash\, creating a vibrant\, shared experience that brings together creativity\, environmental action\, and community connection. \nEnjoy a full day of talks\, exhibits\, food\, and hands-on opportunities to learn and take action. \nWhat to Expect \n🎤 Earth Day Talks @ Trash Bash speaker series\n🌱 Sustainability exhibitors and local organizations\n♻️ Trash Bash experiences and Trashion Fashion designs\n🍴 Food and beverage vendors available throughout the day\n🏆 Community recognition and award announcements
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/earth-day-2026/
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center\, 276 East Napa Street\, Sonoma\, 95476
CATEGORIES:Festival,Holiday,Other
